WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
When avoiding the breath, the breath can be completely hidden from detection.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,600
But I don't need to breathe

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,000
This can do for me

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,900
It is the everlasting cloak of invisibility

5
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:08,800
Next

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,400
Just use the Dark Wings to sneak into the shadowy depths of the base

7
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,900
Avoid all detection

8
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,400
Ah Huai wait for me to take you home

9
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,600
while i'm away

10
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,800
The stronghold enters a full defensive state

11
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,400
No one is allowed to leave the hotel premises without permission.

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:31,100
Take my master with you

13
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:34,960
I love being inside you the most

14
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,560
Then don't come out again

15
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,460
No, that's not what I mean. As long as you're not taking care of children.

16
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,860
I'm still willing to come out
